// The points-to stage, selective: what Argus.Analysis.Extraction runs
// when the full stage (points_to.dl) outgrows its budget. The same
// program, held to the same budget, with the hub objects (those a
// field-insensitive pass finds held by a large share of the program's
// variables) resolved by that pass (clientlib/hub_objects.dl) and every
// other object field-sensitively. It writes the same relations,
// points_to_mode saying "selective", and which objects it resolved so
// (hub_object.csv), for the caller to report.

.include "points_to.dl"

stage_mode("selective").
